<title>GERMANY: Merrill Lynch &quot;buy&quot; boosts Mannesmann.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch &quot;buy&quot; boosts Mannesmann.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German engineering group Mannesmann AG outpaced the broader market Thursday after Merrill Lynch raised the stock to a &quot;buy&quot; from neutral.</p>
<p>Mannesmann shares were trading up 16 marks, or 2.5 percent, at 659.50 marks at 1017 GMT, while the 30-share DAX index was just 0.2 percent ahead at 3,104.56.</p>
<p>Dealers attributed interest in the stock to the Merrill Lynch recommendation and also said Merrill had significantly raised its target price for Mannesmann.</p>
<p>Analysts at Merrill Lynch were not immediately available for detailed comment.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
